#!args --verify-dirty --gen-topology 500 --traffic 300
# performance: 500 devices, 800 cables and 300 frames on the cables at 1920 x 1080 hold 30 fps.
# --gen-topology 500 opens jfn_model::synth's campus without a file (7 core routers in a ring,
# 19 pods of a router, two access switches, PCs, a printer, a camera and servers on both
# switches), --traffic 300 starts 300 pings whose ARP requests leave at t = 0 (jfn_sim
# ping_many).  bench (ui/auto.rs) times frames with the real clock: the passes and the render of
# the dirty cells (--verify-dirty compares afterwards, untimed); a run passes when its median
# stays at or below 33 ms, three runs at most.  Measured: real time while the pings run; the
# simulation mode at t = 0 with the whole campus in view (17 %: squares and dots) while the
# frames move (a step's animation at 0,25×), a pan with the middle button and Ctrl + wheel zoom;
# 100 % over two pods (symbols, names, LEDs, port names, envelopes) while the frames move back,
# pan, zoom and a server dragged; playing at 8×.  #40960 counts the frames on the cables.
size 1920 1080
theme light
expect text:"500 Geräte · 800 Kabel" exists
# everything in view (the window was smaller when the project came)
cmd 23
wait 100
# real time: the engine runs the pings with their ARP, echo and reply frames
bench 30 anim 33000
click tab:"Simulation"
wait 200
cmd 23
wait 100
# 0,25×: a step's animation takes 1,2 s; the view at t = 0 shows the 300 ARP requests
cmd 160
cmd 176 0
wait 100
expect text:"Ansicht bei t = 0,000 000 000 s" exists
expect #40960 value 300
shot build/jfnetworker/perf_fit.png
# a step: the requests run into their switches
key f7
bench 20 anim 33000
bench 20 drag 900,420 1100,520 middle 33000
bench 10 wheel 900,420 120 ctrl 33000
# 100 % over two pods
cmd 23
wait 100
wheel 616,512 720 ctrl
wait 300
expect text:"100 %" exists
shot build/jfnetworker/perf_100.png
# a step back: the frames run back to their senders
key shift+f7
bench 20 anim 33000
bench 20 drag 900,420 1100,520 middle 33000
bench 10 wheel 900,420 120 ctrl 33000
click listitem:"SRV213"
wait 600
bench 20 drag listitem:"SRV213" 1100,400 33000
# playing at 8× (a step every 125 ms)
cmd 165
key f6
bench 40 anim 33000
key f6
shot build/jfnetworker/perf_played.png
expect_nowarn
